<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to LeFC Series 1!</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f4f6f9;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #1a202c;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #f4f6f9;
      padding: 30px 0;
    }
    .email-container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%);
      padding: 32px 28px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    .header-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 8px;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
      border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
      border-radius: 20px;
      color: #60a5fa;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 32px 28px;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: #334155;
    }
    .content p {
      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    }
    .greeting {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #0f172a;
    }
    .social-box {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .social-box p {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #0f172a;
    }
    .social-list {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .social-list li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #475569;
    }
    .social-list li:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .social-list a {
      color: #2563eb;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .social-list a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    .highlight-card {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #1d4ed8 100%);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 24px 0;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }
    .signoff {
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #64748b;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .signoff strong {
      color: #0f172a;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      padding: 16px 28px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="email-container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Welcome to LeFC Series 1! 🎮⚽️</h1>
        <div class="header-badge">EA SPORTS FC Tournament</div>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <p class="greeting">Hi {{firstName}},</p>
        <p>Welcome to LeFC Series 1! Your registration has been successfully received.</p>
        <p>Get ready for an exciting EA SPORTS FC competition featuring 128 players, PlayStation 5, and a ₦5 Million cash prize.</p>
        <p>Keep an eye on your email, WhatsApp and our social media platforms for updates, registration details and event announcements.</p>
        
        <div class="social-box">
          <p>Don't forget to follow us on our social media platforms;</p>
          <ul class="social-list">
            <li><strong>Instagram</strong> - <a href="https://instagram.com/thelefcofficial" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">thelefcofficial</a></li>
            <li><strong>Snapchat</strong> – <a href="https://www.snapchat.com/add/wearelefc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">wearelefc</a></li>
            <li><strong>Tiktok</strong> - <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@thelefcofficial" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">thelefcofficial</a></li>
            <li><strong>X</strong> – <a href="https://x.com/TheLeFCOfficial" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">TheLeFCOfficial</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="highlight-card">
          128 Players. ₦5 Million. One Champion. 🏆
        </div>

        <p>We’re excited to have you on this journey.</p>
        <p>See you on the pitch! 🎮⚽️</p>

        <div class="signoff">
          Warm regards,<br>
          <strong>The LeFC Team</strong><br>
          Lagos eSports Football Championship – Series 1<br>
          <em>Powered by TAPE Gaming</em>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        &copy; Lagos eSports Football Championship. All rights reserved.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
